        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Resonse to a request for evidence regarding the transcript (courses taken; grades obtained; etc.) of tertiary education studies (EQF levels 6/7/8). The transcript may refer to completed or on-going studies  of the person (evidence subject).
Requirement ID: 3</rdfs:comment>
